	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c05gym0101_workman2b_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>リフトを　つかったか？▼
リフトに　のって　うえに　あがれば
いってない　ばしょが　わかるだろ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T04:42:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T04:42:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>リフトを　使ったか？▼
リフトに　乗って　上に　あがれば
行ってない　場所が　わかるだろ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T04:42:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T04:42:59" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・戦闘後メッセージ</Comment>
